    <title>Electric Sunset</title>
    <link>https://www.pbsfm.org.au/program/electric-sunset</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:tahoma,verdana,arial,helvetica,bitstream vera sans,sans-serif; font-size:12px"&gt;Taking you through a feast of musical flavours. From old school to new, the most exquisite electronic, synth based sounds from all eras of dance music. Getting you on your feet for the night ahead, or laid back and into the groove. Expect anything from disco to dubstep, house to hip-hop and electro to breakbeat. DJ Ides means business!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
